---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const updated = 'September 26, 2026';
const contactLine = site.contact.email;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Post and Board Media"
  description="How Post and Board Media collects, uses and protects the information you share through this website."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]}
>
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container--narrow prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>

      <p>
        {site.name} (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through this
        website, how we use it, and the choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only the information you choose to send us through our forms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Advertiser enquiries:</strong> your name, business name, email address and target area, plus any optional details you add, such as advertising format, business category, website, phone number, budget range, timing, message and the opportunity you selected.</li>
        <li><strong>Host applications:</strong> your business name, contact name, email address, area, type of business, and any optional details you add.</li>
        <li><strong>Submission details:</strong> the page you sent the form from and the date and time it was sent.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This website does not use advertising trackers or marketing cookies, and our fonts are served from our own
        website.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry or application and prepare quotes.</li>
        <li>To plan and run the campaigns and sign placements you book.</li>
        <li>If you opt in, to email you when new opportunities open in your area. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>

      <h2>How it’s handled</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are sent securely from our website to our business workflow tools, which deliver them to our
        inbox and records. Our website host may keep short-term technical logs, such as IP addresses, for security and
        reliability. Service providers we use may process information outside Canada.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry and customer information only as long as we need it to serve you and to meet our business and
        legal record-keeping obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or withdraw consent to
        marketing emails, at any time by contacting us.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? {contactLine ? <>Email us at <a href={`mailto:${contactLine}`}>{contactLine}</a>.</> : <>Reach us through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</>}
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows when it last changed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
